2387..2461 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2462..2536 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2537..2615 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2616..2687 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2688..2763 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2764..2844 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2845..2921 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2922..3004 Comment "/// compose to `Path.ap(loopOn, Path.ap(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3005..3077 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3078..3096 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
